~ start
???: We meet again, old friend.
You: You? Why are you here? 
???: I'll get to that, but I've missed you.
You: I really don't feel the same way.
???: I understand.
	You were better off without me around.
You: Yeah, I've been really trying to avoid you.
	So, why are you back?
$> start_tripping()
Death: You invited me in.
	Right inside of you...
You: No.
	You are just trying to get into my head.
Death: I'm already in your stomach,
	entering your blood, and into your head.
You: ...
	Those shrooms were fine...
Death: They were fine 6 months ago.
	You'd never eat bread that blue.
You: ...
	I've had worse.
Death: And each time I've missed you
	by just that much,
Death: but you're luck has run out.
$> start_music()
Death: ...
Death: You feel it, don't you?
Death: The end?
You?: This...
	this is just ego death.
Death: ...
Death: Since you've been good company,
	I'll grant one last mercy...
Death: I'll meet you at the [wave amp=20.0 freq=2.0 connected=1]peak[/wave].
=> END

~ first_collapse
Death: Well, aren't you just a little Schrödinger's cat?
Still You: I'm not dead, yet!
Death: You're on the dead spectrum.
Sounds Like You: I'm going to turn this trip around...
Death: You can drink some water.
	You'll want it.
Losing You: That's ominous...
$> trip_harder()
Still Who?: ...
	Oh no...
...
	[font_size=48]An entire dimension [shake rate=10.0 level=2 connected=1]crumbles[/shake].[/font_size]
=> END

~ second_collapse
Death: You're almost there.
Death: I know you can feel it now.
Barely You: I'm scared.
Death: I know, I'm here.
Barely You: Can I just go back and... redo?
	Everything?
Death: The thing is...
$> trip_harder()
Death: You will...
...
	[font_size=48]Another dimension [shake rate=10.0 level=2 connected=1]crumbles[/shake].[/font_size]
=> END

~ final_collapse
Death: I'm here for you, old friend.
Someone Formerly You: There is no I anymore. 
We are all one.
Death: ...
	We will be soon.
$> trip_harder()
...
	...
	...
	...
...
	[font_size=48]You [shake rate=10.0 level=2 connected=1]crumble[/shake].[/font_size]
